# ---- Local scratch ----
# zz-fe-test.cmd is an abandoned helper from a crashed tooling run: its file
# permissions deny read/write to the signed-in user, so it cannot be deleted
# from this checkout. Ignoring it keeps `git add -A` clean. It is safe to
# remove by hand once the directory is re-created (or from an elevated shell).
scripts/zz-*.cmd
scripts/_*.cmd
scripts/_*.txt
scripts/acl-report-*.jsonl

# The one underscore helper that IS part of the project: the database scripts
# `call` it to locate psql and share the connection parameters.
!scripts/_pg-env.cmd

